{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/17/3197569/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/17/3197569/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/17/3197569/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑エアー握手会だよぉ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/17/3197569/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも元気が出るコメントをありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/17/3197569/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はちょっと最初に\n少しだけど質問返しを..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q 一緒に坂を登らせて下さい！いいですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A 凄く嬉しい...\nありがとう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q 仕事で会いに行けないから頑張ってる俺にエールちょうだい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A 遅くまでお仕事お疲れ様です\n体には気を付けて頑張って下さいね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q 缶ビーフってまさかワンちゃんの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A 大丈夫だよ笑笑...たぶん...！だって食べれたもん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/17/3197569/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q メイクのポイントは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A う〜んアイシャドウはあんまりしないかなぁマスカラは付けてます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q広島の牡蠣は好きですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A もちろん大好きです♪\n生も、フライもグラタンも、大好きです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q 服ってどこで買うの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A好きなのは、リズリサや、イングとかかな〜...でも元気そうな格好も好きです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q 選抜、非選抜に関係なく応援していきます、力になれなくてごめんね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A 全然そんな事ない！こうやってコメントくれたり、まあやの事を思ってくれる時間を持ってくれてる事がどれだけまあやの力になっているか...本当に嬉しいです！\nありがとう\nまあやは素敵な人達に思ってもらえて本当に感謝です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/17/3197569/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日学校行ってたら、雪の氷で滑りました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/17/3197569/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/17/3197569/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/17/3197569/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前歩いてたらまた雪の氷の上で滑ったの、\n川後ちゃんと二人で歩いてたんだけどね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたら川後ちゃんは私の事を無視して私を置き去りにしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/17/3197569/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/17/3197569/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/17/3197569/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あたしを恥ずかしいめにあわせようとしたんです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/17/3197569/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/17/3197569/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まぁでもちょっと歩いたら待っててくれたけどね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/17/3197569/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/17/3197569/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伝わった？意味わかるかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/17/3197569/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/17/3197569/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやぁでも恥ずかしかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/17/3197569/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/17/3197569/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/17/3197569/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもこけはしなかったんですよ！\n氷の上で三秒くらい足をキュコキュコ滑らせてました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/17/3197569/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやぁ恥ずかしい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/17/3197569/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"恥ずかしぃ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/17/3197569/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな恥ずかしい体験ある？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/17/3197569/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/17/3197569/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/17/3197569/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/17/3197569/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/17/3197569/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}